+--!strict
+-- The Feastqueen's gown, bodice and upper skirt (the FeastqueenDress look): a
+-- plain fitted gold bodice crossed by two ivory neckline seams, a single wine
+-- seam at the narrowest point and a wine bow behind. The skirt's first tier
+-- hangs from the thighs as five thin gold facets so it swings with the leg, and
+-- a shade-black creep climbs the front of one side. The amber waist gem is the
+-- chest's one Neon.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local colours = {
+	gold = { 190, 150, 66 },
